  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enhancing Food Security and Livelihood in Bangsamoro</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to support and sustain peacebuilding and recovery in Bangsamoro on a food supply crisis and food price inflation and the delay of livelihood support under the Peace Process through the following two approaches. The first is short-term assistance in providing immediate food distribution among the worst impacted or more marginalized communities in the BARMM and adjacent areas in Mindanao. The second is mid-term support to improve livelihood in Bangsamoro through enhancing the capa</narrative>
  </description>
